<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Word Family Explorer: technique, technician, technical &amp; technically</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f8fafc;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --surface-alt: #f1f5f9;
      --border: #e2e8f0;
      --text: #0f172a;
      --text-muted: #475569;
      --primary: #2563eb;
      --primary-light: #eff6ff;
      --primary-border: #bfdbfe;

      /* Part of speech color coding */
      --adj-bg: #eef2ff;
      --adj-border: #c7d2fe;
      --adj-text: #3730a3;
      --adj-accent: #4f46e5;

      --noun-tech-bg: #ecfdf5;
      --noun-tech-border: #a7f3d0;
      --noun-tech-text: #065f46;
      --noun-tech-accent: #059669;

      --noun-person-bg: #fffbeb;
      --noun-person-border: #fde68a;
      --noun-person-text: #92400e;
      --noun-person-accent: #d97706;

      --adv-bg: #faf5ff;
      --adv-border: #e9d5ff;
      --adv-text: #6b21a8;
      --adv-accent: #9333ea;

      --greek-bg: #f0f9ff;
      --greek-border: #bae6fd;
      --greek-text: #075985;
      --greek-accent: #0284c7;

      --success: #16a34a;
      --success-bg: #f0fdf4;
      --error: #dc2626;
      --error-bg: #fef2f2;

      --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
      --shadow-md: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.07), 0 2px 4px -2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
      --radius: 14px;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Noto Sans TC", "PingFang HK", "Microsoft JhengHei", sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.65;
      padding-bottom: 4rem;
    }

    /* Header & Sticky Controls */
    header {
      background: var(--surface);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }

    .header-inner {
      max-width: 1060px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0.9rem 1.25rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.65rem;
    }

    .brand-badge {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      padding: 0.3rem 0.65rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .brand-title {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .controls-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.6rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    /* Recall Mode Toggle */
    .recall-toggle {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      background: var(--surface-alt);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 0.45rem 0.85rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text);
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      user-select: none;
    }

    .recall-toggle:hover {
      border-color: var(--primary);
    }

    .recall-toggle.active {
      background: #1e293b;
      color: #ffffff;
      border-color: #1e293b;
    }

    .toggle-dot {
      width: 10px;
      height: 10px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #94a3b8;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }

    .recall-toggle.active .toggle-dot {
      background: #38bdf8;
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px #38bdf8;
    }

    /* Section Navigation */
    nav.section-nav {
      background: var(--surface);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      overflow-x: auto;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    }

    .nav-inner {
      max-width: 1060px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .nav-btn {
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 0.42rem 0.8rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.15s ease;
    }

    .nav-btn:hover {
      background: var(--surface-alt);
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .nav-btn.active {
      background: var(--primary-light);
      color: var(--primary);
      border-color: var(--primary-border);
    }

    /* Main Container */
    main {
      max-width: 960px;
      margin: 1.75rem auto;
      padding: 0 1.25rem;
    }

    /* Recall Mode Blur / Reveal Mechanism */
    body.recall-mode .recall-target {
      position: relative;
      background: #e2e8f0 !important;
      color: transparent !important;
      border-radius: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
      user-select: none;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      padding: 0.1rem 0.4rem;
    }

    body.recall-mode .recall-target * {
      color: transparent !important;
    }

    body.recall-mode .recall-target::after {
      content: "Click to reveal";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #334155;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    body.recall-mode .recall-target.revealed {
      background: #fef9c3 !important;
      color: var(--text) !important;
    }

    body.recall-mode .recall-target.revealed * {
      color: inherit !important;
    }

    body.recall-mode .recall-target.revealed::after {
      display: none;
    }

    /* Hero / Intro Card */
    .hero-card {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #f0f9ff 100%);
      border: 1px solid var(--greek-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 1.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    }

    .hero-card h1 {
      font-size: 1.55rem;
      line-height: 1.3;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    }

    .hero-card p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
      font-size: 1.02rem;
    }

    .hero-card p:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    /* Section Cards */
    .lesson-section {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 1.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      scroll-margin-top: 115px;
    }

    .lesson-section.hidden-by-filter {
      display: none;
    }

    .section-header {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      padding-bottom: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--surface-alt);
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .pos-pill {
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .pill-greek { background: var(--greek-bg); color: var(--greek-text); border: 1px solid var(--greek-border); }
    .pill-adj { background: var(--adj-bg); color: var(--adj-text); border: 1px solid var(--adj-border); }
    .pill-noun-tech { background: var(--noun-tech-bg); color: var(--noun-tech-text); border: 1px solid var(--noun-tech-border); }
    .pill-noun-person { background: var(--noun-person-bg); color: var(--noun-person-text); border: 1px solid var(--noun-person-border); }
    .pill-adv { background: var(--adv-bg); color: var(--adv-text); border: 1px solid var(--adv-border); }

    /* Interactive Timeline / Stepper for Section 1 */
    .timeline-tabs {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(210px, 1fr));
      gap: 0.65rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .step-tab {
      text-align: left;
      background: var(--surface-alt);
      border: 2px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .step-tab:hover {
      border-color: var(--greek-accent);
    }

    .step-tab.active {
      background: var(--greek-bg);
      border-color: var(--greek-accent);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }

    .step-tab-num {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--greek-accent);
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
    }

    .step-tab-title {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .step-panel {
      display: none;
      background: var(--greek-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--greek-border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.35rem;
      animation: fadeIn 0.25s ease;
    }

    .step-panel.active {
      display: block;
    }

    .step-nav-footer {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-top: 1.25rem;
      padding-top: 0.85rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--greek-border);
    }

    .btn-step {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--greek-border);
      color: var(--greek-text);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      padding: 0.45rem 0.9rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .btn-step:hover:not(:disabled) {
      background: var(--greek-accent);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .btn-step:disabled {
      opacity: 0.4;
      cursor: not-allowed;
    }

    /* Content Typography & Blocks */
    p {
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    ul.clean-list {
      margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem 1.35rem;
    }

    ul.clean-list li {
      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    }

    .highlight-word {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin: 0.35rem 0 0.65rem;
    }

    .formula-box {
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1rem;
      padding: 0.65rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin: 0.65rem 0 1rem;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .zh-definition {
      display: block;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 0.65rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin: 0.75rem 0 1.15rem;
    }

    /* Example Cards */
    .examples-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
      gap: 0.9rem;
      margin: 0.85rem 0 1.25rem;
    }

    .example-card {
      background: var(--surface-alt);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 1rem;
    }

    .example-num-title {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .example-en {
      font-size: 0.96rem;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    }

    .example-zh {
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    /* Remember Callout */
    .remember-box {
      border-left: 4px solid;
      padding: 0.9rem 1.15rem;
      border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0;
      margin-top: 1.1rem;
    }

    .remember-box-title {
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    /* Tables */
    .table-wrap {
      overflow-x: auto;
      margin: 1rem 0 1.25rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      text-align: left;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    th, td {
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    th {
      background: var(--surface-alt);
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    tr:last-child td {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    /* Section 7 Scenario Cards */
    .scenario-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(210px, 1fr));
      gap: 0.9rem;
      margin: 1rem 0 1.25rem;
    }

    .scenario-card {
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1rem;
      border: 1px solid;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .scenario-caption {
      font-size: 0.76rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
      padding: 0.45rem 0.6rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      border: 1px dashed rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
    }

    /* Section 8 Memory Map Diagram */
    .memory-map {
      background: var(--surface-alt);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .map-node-root {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--greek-bg);
      border: 2px solid var(--greek-accent);
      color: var(--greek-text);
      padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .map-arrow {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin: 0.4rem 0;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .map-branches {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(185px, 1fr));
      gap: 0.85rem;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .map-branch-card {
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 0.9rem;
      border: 1px solid;
    }

    /* Quiz Section */
    .quiz-scoreboard {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      background: #1e293b;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 1rem 1.35rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .score-display {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .score-badge {
      background: #38bdf8;
      color: #0f172a;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      margin-left: 0.4rem;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .quiz-part-title {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--primary);
      margin: 1.5rem 0 0.85rem;
      padding-bottom: 0.35rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .quiz-item {
      background: var(--surface-alt);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.15rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }

    .quiz-item.correct {
      border-color: var(--success);
      background: var(--success-bg);
    }

    .quiz-item.incorrect {
      border-color: var(--error);
      background: var(--error-bg);
    }

    .quiz-q-text {
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .mcq-options {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .mcq-btn {
      text-align: left;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 0.6rem 0.85rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.94rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.15s;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .mcq-btn:hover:not(:disabled) {
      border-color: var(--primary);
      background: var(--primary-light);
    }

    .mcq-btn.selected-correct {
      background: var(--success);
      color: #fff;
      border-color: var(--success);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .mcq-btn.selected-wrong {
      background: var(--error);
      color: #fff;
      border-color: var(--error);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .fill-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.6rem;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .fill-input {
      padding: 0.55rem 0.85rem;
      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.96rem;
      min-width: 210px;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .fill-input:focus {
      outline: none;
      border-color: var(--primary);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.15);
    }

    .btn-check {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      border: none;
      padding: 0.55rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .btn-check:hover {
      background: #1d4ed8;
    }

    .btn-reset {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
      color: #fff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
      padding: 0.45rem 0.9rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .btn-reset:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.24);
    }

    .feedback-msg {
      margin-top: 0.65rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      display: none;
    }

    .feedback-msg.show {
      display: block;
    }

    .feedback-msg.ok { color: var(--success); }
    .feedback-msg.bad { color: var(--error); }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(4px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .hero-card, .lesson-section {
        padding: 1.25rem;
      }
      .hero-card h1 {
        font-size: 1.3rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <div class="header-inner">
      <div class="brand">
        <span class="brand-badge">WORD FAMILY</span>
        <span class="brand-title">technique · technician · technical · technically</span>
      </div>
      <div class="controls-bar">
        <button id="recallToggleBtn" class="recall-toggle" type="button" title="Hide definitions and Chinese translations to test yourself">
          <span class="toggle-dot"></span>
          <span>Recall / Study Mode: <strong id="recallStatusText">OFF</strong></span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav class="section-nav" aria-label="Lesson navigation">
      <div class="nav-inner">
        <button class="nav-btn active" data-target="all">All Sections</button>
        <button class="nav-btn" data-target="sec-1">1. Origin</button>
        <button class="nav-btn" data-target="sec-2">2. Technical (adj.)</button>
        <button class="nav-btn" data-target="sec-3">3. Technique (n.)</button>
        <button class="nav-btn" data-target="sec-4">4. Technician (n.)</button>
        <button class="nav-btn" data-target="sec-5">5. Technically (adv.)</button>
        <button class="nav-btn" data-target="sec-6">6. Word Family</button>
        <button class="nav-btn" data-target="sec-7">7. Don't Confuse</button>
        <button class="nav-btn" data-target="sec-8">8. Memory Map</button>
        <button class="nav-btn" data-target="sec-9">9. Quiz</button>
        <button class="nav-btn" data-target="sec-10">10. Memorise</button>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <!-- Introduction -->
    <div class="hero-card">
      <h1>Let's learn technique, technician, technical and technically step by step.</h1>
      <p>This word family is slightly different from the previous ones because the words are connected to the idea of skill, knowledge and the way we do something.</p>
      <p>The most important thing to understand is their common origin: an Ancient Greek word meaning art, skill or craft.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 1 -->
    <section id="sec-1" class="lesson-section">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="section-title">1. Where do these words come from?</h2>
        <span class="pos-pill pill-greek">Etymology · Ancient Greek</span>
      </div>

      <div class="timeline-tabs" role="tablist">
        <button class="step-tab active" data-step="0" type="button">
          <span class="step-tab-num">Stage 1</span>
          <span class="step-tab-title">Step 1: Ancient Greek – tekhnē</span>
        </button>
        <button class="step-tab" data-step="1" type="button">
          <span class="step-tab-num">Stage 2</span>
          <span class="step-tab-title">Step 2: Ancient Greek – tekhnikos</span>
        </button>
        <button class="step-tab" data-step="2" type="button">
          <span class="step-tab-num">Stage 3</span>
          <span class="step-tab-title">Step 3: How did the words enter English?</span>
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 1 Panel -->
      <div class="step-panel active" data-step-panel="0">
        <h3>Step 1: Ancient Greek – tekhnē</h3>
        <p>Thousands of years ago, the Ancient Greeks used the word:</p>
        <div class="highlight-word" style="background:#fff; color:var(--greek-text); border:1px solid var(--greek-border);">tekhnē</div>
        <p>It meant:</p>
        <ul class="clean-list">
          <li>Art</li>
          <li>Skill</li>
          <li>Craft</li>
          <li>The ability to do something well</li>
        </ul>
        <p>But what does this actually mean?</p>
        <p>Imagine someone making a beautiful painting.</p>
        <p>To create the painting, the person needs:</p>
        <ul class="clean-list">
          <li>Knowledge of colours.</li>
          <li>The ability to use a paintbrush.</li>
          <li>Skills to create different shapes and effects.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>All these abilities are part of the person's tekhnē.</p>
        <p>In simple words:</p>
        <p><strong><span class="recall-target">Tekhnē = The skill or knowledge needed to do something well.</span></strong></p>

