      <h3>Three important things to remember</h3>
      <ol style="margin: 0.65rem 0 1.25rem 1.4rem;">
        <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;"><strong>Origin:</strong> These words are connected to the Ancient Greek word tekhnē, meaning art, skill or craft.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;"><strong>Word formation:</strong> Technical + -ly = technically. The suffix -ly changes the adjective into an adverb.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:0.5rem;"><strong>Word meanings:</strong>
          <ul class="clean-list" style="margin-top:0.3rem;">
            <li><strong>Technique</strong> = <span class="recall-target">Method or skill.</span></li>
            <li><strong>Technician</strong> = <span class="recall-target">Person.</span></li>
            <li><strong>Technical</strong> = <span class="recall-target">Related to special skills or knowledge.</span></li>
            <li><strong>Technically</strong> = <span class="recall-target">In a technical way or according to exact rules.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </li>
      </ol>

      <div class="remember-box" style="background:var(--primary-light); border-color:var(--primary);">
