        <p>Imagine you are learning to repair a computer:</p>
        <ul class="clean-list">
          <li>The <strong>technician</strong> is the person.</li>
          <li>The <strong>technique</strong> is the method.</li>
          <li>The <strong>technical</strong> knowledge is what the person needs.</li>
          <li><strong>Technically</strong>, the computer is working correctly.</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-bottom:0;">If you can remember this one situation, you can understand the differences between all four words!</p>
